      en: ["The Viekšniai pharmacy was established as early as 1859.", "The town is situated within the scenic Venta Regional Park.", "Aviation pioneer Aleksandras Griškevičius resided here during the mid-1800s.", "The Church of St. John the Baptist was completed in 1854.", "The historic watermill is one of the most significant industrial sites in the area.", "Magdeburg rights were granted to the town in 1791 by the Grand Duke."],
